				blocks (Body, List, Anchor, Blockquote) keep their own type.
			</p>
			<Prose style="max-inline-size: 44rem;">
				<Body>The first paragraph of a post, set in the body role. It carries an <Anchor href="#" underline>inline link</Anchor> and some <code>inline code</code> to show both against the reading colour.</Body>
				<H2>A section heading</H2>
				<Body>A paragraph under the heading, spaced tighter to it than to the block before it, so the heading holds onto what it introduces.</Body>
				<Blockquote>
					<Body>A quoted passage: the first wash as a fill, a bar of the third wash on the left, and the surface radius on the right corners only.</Body>
				</Blockquote>
				<H3>A sub-heading</H3>
